WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.740
That doll can grant you any wish.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.160
Any wish?

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.120
But you only get a total of 3 wishes.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.420
Really, any wish is fine?

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:18.760
Of course. But I'm the one who's granting them so you can't wish for something that I can't do.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:21.890
Then, the first wish...

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.260
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

