<b>Promise</b>

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:10.020
Morning! It's morning!
<b>Promise</b>

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:10.700
Morning! It's morning!

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:13.500
Let's eat breakfast and go to sch-!

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.670
Yuuichi-san, good morning.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:24.630
Good morning...

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:26.640
You're up early even though it's a holiday.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.100
Nayuki's alarm clock is so powerful.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.270
I see.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:35.600
Itadakimasu.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.440
It seems that it was snowing last night.

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:47.910
It's so quiet...

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:49.700
Yeah, you're right...

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.200
Yes...

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.500
Oh yes, Yuuichi-san.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.120
Yes?

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:56.710
I won this at the lottery at the shopping district.

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.460
A ticket for a movie.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.920
It's for the theater at the front of the station, but it seems they expire today,

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.010
and also, it's wasteful not to go, so...

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.630
Then, I'll invite Nayuki...

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:12.010
Nayuki is at a track competition in the neighboring town.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.100
I see...

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.740
Yuuichi-kun!

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:29.820
Whoa! Ayu!?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.370
Who were you waiting for?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.830
Is it me by any chance?

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.750
Why would I have to wait for you?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.250
Your aren't?

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.420
Of course not.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:41.500
You didn't have to say it that directly.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.920
What other way is there to say it?

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.010
I don't know, but...

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.390
Yuuichi-kun, what is that?

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.600
Tickets to a movie.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.390
I got them from Akiko-san.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.060
Who are you going with?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.100
I haven't decided yet.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.360
Would you be interested in going?

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:04.650
I'd like to see the movie with Yuuichi-kun.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:07.690
I understand.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.450
Then, how about we watch it together, Ayu?

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:10.320
Yeah!

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.290
It's not that much of a scary thing.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.130
Aghuu! Give it back!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.500
It's rare to see a movie, so just enjoy this atmosphere.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.880
I'm enjoying it! Give it back!

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.550
I said no, geez.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.180
Give it back!
I said no, geez.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:30.470
I said no, geez.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.260
Let's try hard next time too.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.680
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.900
That was fun.

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:42.770
Yeah!

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:46.190
Although, Ayu was funnier than the movie.

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:48.240
Ughuu, you're mean.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:53.160
But it's great.

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.120
What is?

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.040
It seems that Yuuichi-kun's more cheerful.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.630
The Yuuichi-kun from a little while ago looked so lonely.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:12.890
It seemed like you were sitting here, and waiting here for someone who wouldn't come.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:14.340
Ayu...

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:18.100
Yuuichi-kun, you look better when you laugh.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:24.860
That's something I said to Ayu in the past.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:25.770
Was it?

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:27.860
Don't copy, you...!

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.280
Yuuichi-kun, it hurts!

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.400
You you!
Yuuichi-kun, it hurts!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.740
Yuuichi-kun, it hurts!

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.280
Hey, wait!

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.290
Shall we eat somewhere?

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.540
Yeah, that's good.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:41.750
What should we eat?

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:44.330
It would be better if it's something that's filling.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.210
I'm sorry, but I'll go home.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:48.800
Why?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.670
I want to go home early today.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.720
Do you have something important to do?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:56.390
I don't but... I'm sorry.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.270
Do you remember this bench?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:10.690
This is the place where Yuuichi-kun and I arranged to meet.

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:16.660
I'm missing my memories from the past... Seven years ago is like a big hole...

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.490
It is...?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.120
Coming back to this town again,

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.580
I didn't know why, but I was very hesitant...

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.250
I was only in this town for a short time but...

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.250
Many things happened...

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.550
There were fun things happening,

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:32.920
but there were many sad things too...

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.470
If I wasn't forced to come back to this town...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.700
I never would have...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:41.060
I am very happy Yuuichi-kun came back to this town.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:48.110
Because I was sitting on this bench waiting for Yuuichi-kun the whole time.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.440
For the whole, whole time...

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.610
For the whole time, I was waiting.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:57.410
So...

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.630
It's a thank you, Yuuichi-kun...

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:18.180
Huh? What's wrong?

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.390
So you felt like eating something?

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:30.360
I'm sorry.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.730
I ignored Yuuichi-kun's feelings...

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:34.690
Idiot...

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:37.610
If you say that, I'm also gonna get embarrassed.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:38.360
Because...

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.610
No "Because..."

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:40.870
Ughuu...

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.170
Thanks, Ayu.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:52.880
Yeah!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.060
Oh, welcome home.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.930
Did you run back?

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:08.980
Because I was late...

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:10.560
You're hungry, right?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.650
I'll prepare dinner right away.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:20.700
I'm home!

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.780
Oh, Nayuki. You were home?

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.370
Yeah...

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.370
Good afternoon.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.290
Oh, Ayu-chan.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.380
I met her at the station by chance.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:33.960
Oh, I see.

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.920
I was about to prepare dinner right now.

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.010
If it's okay, stay with us for dinner, Ayu-chan.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.010
Oh! Yeah, you're right!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.140
How about staying over for the night?

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:46.930
It's okay?

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:48.350
Of course.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:51.600
Nayuki, you can lend her some pajamas, right?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:52.900
Yeah...

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:54.940
I'm okay with it...

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:57.570
Thank you, Nayuki-san!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.360
Then come in, Ayu-chan.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:05.660
Mom, I already ate outside, so I don't need supper.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:25.390
You can come in.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.350
I saw light from the opening.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:29.850
Is it okay for a while?

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.020
Yeah. Those pajamas...

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.730
As I thought, it doesn't fit?

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.230
I'm small, so...

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.150
Breasts?

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.110
That's not it!

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:43.820
Although, that's not wrong either...

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:45.030
Which is it?

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.580
Ughuuu.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.790
Is it something important?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.040
I just wanted to talk.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:52.910
Is that a problem?

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:00.210
You already took a bath, right?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.260
Why are you wearing a hairband?

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.680
Do you remember the thing I said before?

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:08.010
This is something I got from the person most precious to me.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.600
Oh yeah, you said something like that before.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.770
Then, do you remember about that day?

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:14.940
That day?

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:19.440
About the day when Yuuichi-kun gave me this hairband as a present...

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:22.740
Yeah, Yuuichi-kun.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:26.700
Yuuichi-kun, you are my most precious person.

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:27.870
Ayu...

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:29.280
I...

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.000
It seems like you don't remember it...

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:35.670
I'm sorry...

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:37.960
Seven years have passed...

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:43.920
Also, even though you forgot, the hairband I got from Yuuichi-kun is right here...

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:48.640
And, Yuuichi-kun is right in front of me right now...

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:50.880
Thanks.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.850
Hm?

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:55.310
I wanted to show my gratitude, Yuuichi-kun...

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.080
It doesn't suit me anymore...?

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.500
I wonder...

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.380
Well, good night, Yuuichi-kun.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.300
Yeah.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.390
Oh yeah, that hairband is...

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.100
Where was that?

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.320
My first wish...

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.780
Please don't forget about me...

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:54.040
Even if the winter break ends and you return to your town,

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:57.750
I don't mind if it's occasionally, but please remember about me...

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:03.670
"Speaking of which, I met a weird girl in the town of snow..." just that is fine,

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.550
but don't forget about me please...

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:08.880
That's... my first wish...

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:13.640
Oh, Nayuki, what's wrong?

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.350
I have club activities again today, I have to hurry...

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:17.770
You really have a lot going on.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:18.770
Yeah...

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:20.400
Are you okay for time?

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:22.360
I just want to see this corner...

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:22.690
Your luck for this week
12 Zodiac Fortune~

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:23.900
