"The lucky item is a love novel."

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:40.830
There's no need to worry about it.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.210
Yeah...

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.460
Hey mom...

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:46.880
What is it?

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:49.260
A long time ago...

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:53.470
I think I've met Ayu-chan before...

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.810
Nothing... Gochisousama.
(Note: Gochisousama = an expression said after finishing a meal.)

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.600
I'll leave now...

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:01.190
It's alright already?

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:02.020
Yeah...

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:03.810
Oh, Nayuki.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:05.270
Yuuichi, good morning...

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.650
You're early.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:09.780
She seems to have a club activity now.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:11.360
I see.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.030
I'm leaving.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:13.950
Come back safely.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:14.990
Be careful.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.410
Yeah...

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:18.950
Yuuichi-san.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:24.000
Do you remember what happened in this town seven years ago during the winter?

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.420
What is it all of a sudden?

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:28.250
Nope, it's nothing important.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:29.420
Huh...

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:30.590
Good morning!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:31.840
Good morning, Ayu-chan.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:35.640
Then I'll get things ready for Yuuichi-san and Ayu-chan's breakfast.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:36.640
Yay!

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.720
I'm saying, be more reserved.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:42.980
It's cold.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.020
Yeah, you're right.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:47.270
Shouldn't school be closed if it's this cold?

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.730
My school will be closed.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:51.700
It is?

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.530
You can be absent when you want to be.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.700
Where in the world are there schools like that?

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:57.870
There are.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.160
Well, it's a school even Ayu can attend.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.660
You're mean!

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:04.870
It's my favorite school!

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.000
A joke... It's a joke!!!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:07.540
Let go of me!
A joke... It's a joke!!!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.880
Let go of me!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:13.340
Oh yeah, I wanted to ask this before, but what's in here?

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.510
"What"? It's just normal stuff.

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:20.390
Textbooks, notebooks, CDs, magazines and other such things, some of which I borrowed from my friends.

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.430
Hm, it really seems to be normal stuff.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.060
That's why I said it is.

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.360
Is it crooked?

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.690
It's alright.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.110
Anyway, is this the right way?

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:37.370
Ughuu, I went too far.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:38.410
You're an idiot.

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:39.740
I'm not an idiot!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.910
It's because Yuuichi-kun was being mean to me.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.160
I'm sorry for that.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.250
Yeah, you should be.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.250
Then see you later, Yuuichi-kun.

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:50.750
Ayu.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:52.170
What is it?

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.130
Today, after school, why don't we play again?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.180
Wait at the bench,

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:59.180
we'll buy some taiyaki at the shopping district,

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.970
play some games, and then...

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:03.810
I want to see Ayu's favorite school.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.890
Yeah, that's okay with me.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:18.820
Oh yeah, have you found your lost item?

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.830
I still can't find it.

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:24.790
But maybe, it would be okay if I didn't find it.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:25.580
Eh?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:27.080
Why?

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.420
Because I'm happy.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.750
About meeting Yuuichi-kun again...

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.260
About all the things I can talk with Yuuichi-kun about...

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:42.430
About being like this with Yuuichi-kun... It's a moment that can't be replaced for me.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:46.140
If you're happy, then why are you making a face like that?

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.480
It makes me anxious.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:51.020
I'm scared to be this happy.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:55.360
"The reality in front of me was all a dream that someone was watching,"

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:57.820
"and someday it will be gone." Like that...

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:00.740
Hey, Yuuichi-kun,

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:04.790
was there a time where you've lost an important person?

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:07.750
It seems that you have...

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:09.540
I also have too...

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.000
I couldn't do anything about it...

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.880
I could only cry...

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.420
I could only call the person's name while crying...

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:19.590
I'm not going anywhere!

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:21.970
When winter ends, and the spring comes,

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.640
even if the snow melts, I'll be in this town forever.

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.270
I'll be near Ayu forever.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:27.640
Yuuichi-kun,

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.520
it hurts if you squeeze that hard.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.650
I'm not going anywhere.

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:37.440
Yuuichi-kun...

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:41.320
I have small breasts...

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:42.780
I'm a scardy-cat...

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.660
I can't even cook a meal properly...

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.580
I love Ayu.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.500
Yuuichi-kun...

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.290
I love you, Ayu.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.960
Even if you come to regret it?

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.000
I won't ever regret it!

00:16:56.550 --> 00:16:59.010
Then, I also won't regret it...

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:02.840
Because, Yuuichi-kun's body is so warm...

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.140
I love you too, Yuuichi-kun...

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.560
I really love you...

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:15.400
Maybe the item I was trying to find was something I don't need when I have happiness...

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:28.830
But, you sure take a weird path to school.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.870
You think so, Yuuichi-kun?

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:41.590
Here! This is my school!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.090
Where?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:46.470
Huh?

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.690
Ayu, there's only a stump here.

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:54.520
No, it's not...

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:57.020
The school that I was attending...

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.610
I attended it today too...

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:03.990
It can't be...

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.580
I'm serious!

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.040
This was my school!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:14.000
My favorite school that I attended until today!!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.000
Ayu...

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.960
I got the hairband, right!?

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.000
I got it right here from Yuuichi-kun, right!?

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.300
Yuuichi-kun, why!?

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:25.430
Why don't you remember it!?

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:26.550
It can't be!!!

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.220
That can't be it!!!

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.020
I know...

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:36.440
Really.. I know... Here...

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:38.440
I... Right here...

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.030
Ayu, what's wrong?

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.150
Why!?

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.450
I need to find it...

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:48.950
I gotta find it...

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.870
Hey, Ayu!

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.580
What's wrong right now?

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:54.000
No, it can't be...

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:57.080
I'm not allowed to be here...

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.170
I'm a human being that isn't allowed to be here...

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.130
No, it can't be...

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:03.510
No, it can't be!!!

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:05.840
No, it can't be!!!!!!

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:07.760
My second wish...

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:11.260
I want to attend the same school as Yuuichi-kun...

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.730
Going to the same school together,

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.940
and studying together,

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:18.020
and eating the school lunch together,

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.060
and cleaning up together,

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:23.900
and also I want to go home with Yuuichi-kun together...

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:25.110
It's not here...!

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.200
It's not here...!!

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:27.410
It's not here...!!!

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.610
Why isn't it here!!!!!!?

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:29.530
Stop!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:31.120
You're hands are all cut up!

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:33.660
Promise...

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.660
Ayu, stop!

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:39.460
No, it can't be...

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:40.960
Yuuichi-kun...

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:42.920
Why...?

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:46.590
What's wrong, Ayu!?

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:49.300
I'm sorry,

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:50.760
it's nothing...

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:54.060
I just remembered about the days in the past...

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:55.430
"Nothing"?

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.440
It's true.

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:00.310
I'm just looking for the stuff I lost...

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:03.480
Is it buried here?

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.450
Let's look for it tomorrow, okay?

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:10.990
I'll also help.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:13.490
I can't...

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.210
Maybe, the sun won't rise up anymore...

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:22.540
I'm sorry.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.670
In a time when we finally met again...

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.420
In a time when we're friends again...

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.260
In a time...

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.470
But,

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:33.550
I think we won't be able to meet each other again.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.180
What are you talking about!?

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:41.350
Ayu?

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.480
I'm really sorry...

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.230
Ayu! Where are you!?

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:47.440
I'm really sorry...

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:48.320
Ayu!

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.280
Ayu!!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:53.700
AYUUUUUU!!!!!!!!!!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.250
I'm watching a dream from the past...

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.250
The repeating of the same day...

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.330
In the endless dream,

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.750
wishing for the morning that doesn't come...

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:08.710
And,

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:11.760
coming back to the same dream...

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:15.390
It was red and white,

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.180
cold and warm,

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.310
sorrowful and joyful,

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:21.770
and...

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.650
And the same day repeats...

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:30.570
From a long time ago, from many years ago, I noticed it...

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:34.320
Floating in the endless dream,

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:38.620
wishing for the dawn that doesn't come,

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.620
I was in the same place for the whole time...

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.080
The crowd where their voices disappeared...

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.210
People without faces, coming and going in front of my sight...

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:51.340
No one even cared about one girl...

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:53.800
I'm waiting for someone...

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:56.470
A person that I know who won't come...

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:59.600
A person I know that I can't see anymore...

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.600
For many, many years...

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:07.770
In the repeating dream, I was waiting for the whole time...

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:12.150
The dawn that doesn't come forever...

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:30.190
In between the flowing clouds
nagareru kunono aimani

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:35.930
The crawling blue sky
muzuita aozora ga

00:22:36.550 --> 00:22:41.610
Even causes the familiar town
minareta machinami de sae

00:22:41.870 --> 00:22:47.080
To light up
kagayakasete kureru

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:52.920
Running small back
kaketeku chiisana senaka

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.810
The two at that time were...
anokoro no futariga

00:22:59.220 --> 00:23:04.230
The reason for the spilling pain
koboreru itami no wakewo

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:09.970
Hidden with innocence
mujyakisa de kakushita

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:18.340
Time is flowing quietly
tokiwa shizukani nagare

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:23.970
The gentle winds blow
yasashii kaze ga fuita

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:29.600
Numbed feelings too will
Kajikanda omoimo

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:35.850
Change to a smile
egao ni kawarukara

